  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can slam into opponents with stunning speed.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Quick Bull Rush<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Once per round you may perform the bull rush combat maneuver as a free action against a foe within reach and add your mythic tier to the combat maneuver check. You may not move with your opponent unless you spend 1 point of mythic power, which allows you to move up to your speed with your opponent.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc38\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
